---
import PageShell from "@layouts/PageShell.astro";
import PageHeader from "@components/ui/PageHeader.astro";
import { site, whatsappUrl } from "@config/site";

const locale = "en" as const;
const c = site.brand;
const wa = whatsappUrl();
---

<PageShell
  title="Flight policies and restrictions"
  description="Punctuality, the day of the flight, changes, bad weather, minors, weight, safety restrictions and recommendations."
  logicalPath="/politicas-y-restricciones"
  activeId=""
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Flight policies and restrictions"
    lead="The most common questions, in short: arrive on time, on a shared flight the balloon takes off without you. If the weather prevents flying, your flight is rescheduled and you have 3 months to use it. Changes are made 48 hours in advance."
  />

  <article class="legal container-narrow">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>

    <h2>Punctuality</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Being on time is required: 10 minutes of tolerance.</li>
      <li>
        Passengers have a maximum tolerance of 15 minutes. After that, the flight will be shorter.
      </li>
      <li>
        On shared flights the balloon will take off without you, with no right to rescheduling or
        refund.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The day of your flight</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Bring your booking, printed or digital, along with an official ID.</li>
      <li>
        If you paid the deposit with a card, you must present that same card physically along with
        your ID.
      </li>
      <li>
        There you can pay the balance, in cash or by credit or debit card: cards carry a 3 %
        commission charge.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Changes and cancellations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You have 48 hours to change your booking. After that, a 30 % penalty applies.</li>
      <li>Not showing up on your flight day incurs a charge of 100 % of the deposit and/or the flight.</li>
      <li>
        Deposits are non-refundable. The only exception is foreign passengers, with a passport or
        visa and/or a verifiable itinerary.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Bad weather</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        With rain or wind over 20 km/h, for your safety the flight is cancelled and rescheduled to
        the date you choose. You have 3 months to take it.
      </li>
      <li>
        If you booked ground transport and the flight is cancelled due to bad weather, the
        transport service is covered 100 %.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Minors</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every minor must fly accompanied by an adult and follow the pilot's instructions.</li>
      <li>
        The recommended age to fly is 4 years or 1.10 m tall, since an adult is not allowed to hold
        them during the flight.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Weight and booking details</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        It is very important that booking details are truthful, including weights and health
        conditions.
      </li>
      <li>
        The maximum weight per passenger is 99 kilos at no charge. Above that, $50 MXN is charged
        per extra kilo, collected by the crew on the day of the flight.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Restrictions to fly</h2>
    <p>For safety reasons, the following cannot fly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pregnant women.</li>
      <li>People who have consumed alcohol in the 12 hours before the flight.</li>
      <li>People with blood pressure issues.</li>
      <li>People with cardio-respiratory conditions.</li>
      <li>People with recent surgeries or spine and/or knee problems.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>During the flight</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The passenger must heed and obey the pilot's instructions at all times.</li>
      <li>
        Touching connections, tanks or ropes, inside or outside the balloon, is strictly
        prohibited. If instructions are not followed, the flight is cancelled without a refund.
      </li>
      <li>
        The estimated flight time is 45 to 60 minutes. If the pilot decides to make it shorter for
        safety reasons, it is not grounds for a refund.
      </li>
      <li>
        Bringing backpacks, suitcases or bags aboard is not allowed. You can leave them in the
        lockers at the launch site.
      </li>
      <li>Smoking is strictly prohibited in the takeoff area, during the flight and at landing.</li>
      <li>
        Use of camera equipment or phones is at the user's own risk, and selfie sticks are strictly
        prohibited.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Recommendations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Wear comfortable, country-outing clothes: jeans, sneakers, a cap. Bring something warm, it
        gets quite cold. Avoid heels and skirts.
      </li>
      <li>Use sunscreen. After the flight, a light layer.</li>
      <li>Plan the activity without rush: it takes time.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="legal-contact">
      Questions about this document? Message us on
      <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or at
      <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: var(--space-md) var(--space-3xl);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal p + ul {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .legal-contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
